      "title": "India bloomed, doomsayers doomed: PM Modi on 7.8% GDP growth in Q1",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/india-bloomed-doomsayers-doomed-pm-modi-on-7-8-gdp-growth-in-q1-126083100911_1.html",
      "description": "The prime minister said that India's exemplary GDP growth during Q1 of FY 2026-27 is a \"herculean feat\"",
